    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking - generate strings</span><span class=\"chip\">Catalan</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/generate-parentheses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 22</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Generate Parentheses</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build the string one character at a time and allow only legal moves: add '(' while fewer than n are used, add ')' while it closes an open one (close &lt; open). Every branch then ends in a valid answer, so the work is proportional to the output: about 4^n / n^1.5 strings of length 2n.</p>\n"
